        "subject": "LU-20882 scripts: avoid commit-msg temp file leak",
        "message": "LU-20882 scripts: avoid commit-msg temp file leak\n\nThe commit-msg hook created its temporary message file before\nopening the input, so a missing or unreadable message file, or\nno argument, left a stray \"<name>.XXXXXX\" file behind.\n\nOpen the input first and create the temporary file only once\nit is known to be readable.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nFixes: 25c93758d6b1 (\"LU-1199 build: Clean out the build directory\")\nAssisted-by: Codex:gpt-6.1-sol\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I79cfc4c50615e071242ac1a629e99f8f07fa6ce5\n"
      },
